WEBVTT

01:32.840 --> 01:36.160
OUR GENERATION

01:36.200 --> 01:39.500
EPISODE 8

01:43.060 --> 01:45.280
I think you did well this time.

01:46.940 --> 01:49.100
Well, you didn't tried hard and still

01:49.140 --> 01:50.400
landed fifth from the bottom.

01:50.440 --> 01:51.880
I did try.

01:51.920 --> 01:54.140
I really did.

01:54.180 --> 01:55.740
What class are you in again?

01:55.780 --> 01:57.380
Jialin Experimental Middle School.

01:57.420 --> 01:58.820
Class 18.

01:58.860 --> 02:00.380
Not coming dead last is already something.

02:00.420 --> 02:02.980
Anyway, I'm very proud of you.

02:03.480 --> 02:06.560
I think you did great, okay?

02:07.280 --> 02:10.100
This has nothing to do with effort.

02:10.139 --> 02:11.960
- So you're saying I'm just dumb?
- Let's eat.

02:12.740 --> 02:13.880
- Have some soup first.
- Hot!

02:18.420 --> 02:20.440
Mmm, smells great. What is it?

02:20.980 --> 02:21.820
Pig brain soup.

02:21.860 --> 02:22.760
I made it just for you.

02:22.800 --> 02:24.280
Good for your brain, they say.

02:27.800 --> 02:29.540
You really do think I'm dumb.

02:30.640 --> 02:32.040
What are you two laughing at?

02:33.740 --> 02:35.320
My parents made me pig brain soup.

02:35.360 --> 02:37.000
That's love right there.

02:38.100 --> 02:39.020
I flunked

02:39.060 --> 02:40.460
and didn't even get yelled at.

02:40.960 --> 02:41.840
Hey Yingtao,

02:41.880 --> 02:43.920
don't talk like your mom
ever laid a hand on you.

02:43.960 --> 02:45.560
I am the one got whipped by tag team

02:45.600 --> 02:46.700
since day one.

02:47.640 --> 02:49.160
Though this time, no beating.

02:49.200 --> 02:50.460
They saw the report card

02:50.500 --> 02:51.700
and found out Yu Qiao

02:51.740 --> 02:53.140
ranked 15th from the bottom.

02:53.180 --> 02:55.440
They figured the test
must've been really tough.

02:55.480 --> 02:56.420
Not ranking dead last

02:56.460 --> 02:57.600
was a win in their eyes.

02:58.400 --> 02:59.820
You sure are proud of that.

03:01.900 --> 03:03.000
Hey Yu Qiao,

03:03.040 --> 03:04.440
what happened with your test?

03:04.480 --> 03:07.240
I heard you bombed it on purpose.

03:07.280 --> 03:08.740
You usually do way better than this.

03:08.780 --> 03:10.140
Never.

03:10.180 --> 03:12.180
Come on, would I tank a test on purpose?

03:12.680 --> 03:13.720
I just

03:13.760 --> 03:14.780
didn't do well this time.

03:15.280 --> 03:16.980
I needed an excuse when people asked.

03:17.480 --> 03:18.380
Better

03:18.420 --> 03:19.980
than admitting I tanked it.

03:22.800 --> 03:24.680
There are fifteen of us

03:24.720 --> 03:26.200
in the tutoring class.

03:26.240 --> 03:27.860
Three from Qunshan.

03:27.900 --> 03:29.420
That's a fifth of the class.

03:31.080 --> 03:32.260
We better represent.

03:32.300 --> 03:33.380
Let's not embarrass

03:33.420 --> 03:34.320
our hometown, yeah?

03:36.040 --> 03:37.180
How about this?

03:37.220 --> 03:38.920
I'll ask my mom
to make more pig brain soup,

03:38.960 --> 03:40.180
we'll all have some.

03:41.040 --> 03:43.140
No thanks. You can have my share.

03:45.880 --> 03:47.240
Seriously though, Yu Qiao,

03:47.740 --> 03:49.380
no matter what happens,

03:49.420 --> 03:51.460
don't start fights at school.

03:52.660 --> 03:54.440
I only fought because I saw you do it.

03:55.860 --> 03:56.860
I…

03:57.360 --> 03:59.540
Of all my great traits,

03:59.580 --> 04:01.000
you only picked up the worst ones.

04:01.800 --> 04:02.880
You?

04:03.380 --> 04:05.740
What other good qualities
can you share with me?

04:32.320 --> 04:34.040
- Give me the paper.
- I'm not done yet.

04:34.080 --> 04:35.100
Not yours.

04:42.620 --> 04:43.460
Still cheating here?

04:43.500 --> 04:44.740
Real impressive.

04:59.100 --> 05:02.160
AIM HIGH, STUDY HARD, AND THINK DEEPLY

05:06.100 --> 05:08.660
Yu Qiao, why aren't you finished yet?

05:08.700 --> 05:10.960
You're usually good at physics.

05:11.460 --> 05:13.220
I'm just double-checking, sir.

05:13.260 --> 05:14.700
No need. Hand it in.

05:15.520 --> 05:16.500
Alright.

05:25.920 --> 05:27.020
Stop writing.

05:27.520 --> 05:28.660
I can't hold up any longer.

05:29.620 --> 05:30.560
Wanna copy mine?

05:30.600 --> 05:31.820
Just go.

05:31.860 --> 05:33.220
- I got this.
- Then hurry up.

05:33.260 --> 05:34.380
Looks alright.

05:34.420 --> 05:35.900
- Okay, go home.
- Thanks, sir.

05:40.300 --> 05:41.620
Lin Qile, Cai Fangyuan,

05:41.660 --> 05:42.900
why are you two still dawdling?

05:42.940 --> 05:43.960
Have you finished?

05:44.740 --> 05:46.380
- Almost done.
- Hand it in first.

05:46.420 --> 05:47.260
Let me see.

05:47.760 --> 05:50.100
Hey, good luck.

05:54.580 --> 05:57.520
You can't just memorize formulas
for the sake of it.

05:57.560 --> 05:59.980
You have to use abstract thinking.

06:00.020 --> 06:02.300
The ball falls naturally

06:02.340 --> 06:03.520
and hits the spring.

06:03.560 --> 06:04.540
The spring compresses.

06:04.580 --> 06:06.580
The force builds up.

06:26.640 --> 06:27.660
Coming!

06:29.120 --> 06:30.860
Yingtao. Yingtao!

06:30.900 --> 06:32.240
Yu Qiao's here.

06:32.280 --> 06:33.220
Okay.

06:33.900 --> 06:35.980
Yu Qiao, talk some sense into her.

06:36.020 --> 06:37.740
She's been glued to that desk
since she got back.

06:37.780 --> 06:38.900
Hasn't moved at all.

06:39.480 --> 06:41.420
Don't worry, Auntie Juan. Leave it to me.

06:41.460 --> 06:43.120
Alright, I'll let you handle it.

06:43.160 --> 06:44.000
- Just go.
- Okay.

06:58.000 --> 06:59.020
What?

06:59.060 --> 07:00.760
Why are you fighting yourself like this?

07:02.260 --> 07:03.640
Don't distract me.

07:03.680 --> 07:05.360
Otherwise, I'll fight you instead.

07:06.120 --> 07:07.820
Relax.

07:07.860 --> 07:08.780
I'm here to help.

07:08.820 --> 07:09.880
Help me?

07:10.680 --> 07:11.560
Physics, you know,

07:12.100 --> 07:13.840
isn't something I was good at right away.

07:14.340 --> 07:16.260
But I figured it out. And now I can

07:16.300 --> 07:17.360
pass that wisdom on to you.

07:19.220 --> 07:20.580
- Please.
- But I've got conditions.

07:20.620 --> 07:23.080
- Say it.
- Sports Day's coming.

07:23.120 --> 07:24.400
I'm signing up for basketball.

07:24.440 --> 07:25.840
You need to be in my cheering squad.

07:28.040 --> 07:29.680
That's it?

07:29.720 --> 07:31.260
Even if you didn't ask,

07:31.300 --> 07:33.140
I'd still cheer for you, okay?

07:33.180 --> 07:34.440
You better mean that.

07:35.340 --> 07:38.220
To understand physics,
you've gotta feel it.

07:38.760 --> 07:39.600
Feel it?

07:39.640 --> 07:42.620
Didn't you say you'd show me the way?

07:43.420 --> 07:44.800
Why the balloon?

07:47.640 --> 07:48.560
Lin Yingtao,

07:48.600 --> 07:50.440
here's your mission.

07:50.480 --> 07:51.840
Don't let the balloon hit the floor.

07:51.880 --> 07:52.920
Here.

07:53.920 --> 07:55.000
What is this?

07:57.200 --> 07:58.340
Feel the air resistance.

07:58.380 --> 07:59.400
Feel the magic of physics.

08:01.520 --> 08:02.740
Are you messing with me?

08:03.520 --> 08:04.580
Lin Yingtao,

08:04.620 --> 08:05.460
trust me.

08:05.500 --> 08:07.480
If you don't go through this today,

08:07.520 --> 08:09.800
you might not solve that problem tomorrow.

08:10.300 --> 08:12.320
But if you can keep that balloon
off the ground

08:12.360 --> 08:14.000
for 30 minutes,

08:14.500 --> 08:16.420
you've got a good shot at cracking it.

08:16.460 --> 08:18.360
If you don't believe me, go back now.

08:19.420 --> 08:20.540
Really?

08:21.720 --> 08:22.560
Fine.

08:23.580 --> 08:25.440
If I don't get the answer tomorrow,

08:25.480 --> 08:27.280
I'll smack you as many times

08:27.320 --> 08:28.380
as I bopped this balloon.

08:28.960 --> 08:31.060
No more talking. Just focus.

08:36.659 --> 08:37.640
Here.

09:12.200 --> 09:13.220
What's your deal?

09:13.260 --> 09:15.060
If you wanna play, play properly.

09:15.100 --> 09:16.320
What'd the balloon ever do to you?

09:17.140 --> 09:19.780
Yu Qiao, you're seriously annoying.

09:20.500 --> 09:21.920
What's up with the ringtones?

09:23.360 --> 09:24.240
What ringtones?

09:26.260 --> 09:27.920
Lin Yingtao, call me.

09:28.420 --> 09:29.500
Call you?

09:45.900 --> 09:47.300
Why are you laughing?

09:48.020 --> 09:50.540
I've gotten three custom ringtones
this week.

09:50.580 --> 09:51.720
I was so confused.

09:52.220 --> 09:54.040
I didn't even sing the song.

09:54.080 --> 09:55.440
How is that my fault?

09:55.480 --> 09:57.320
I called customer service.

09:57.360 --> 09:58.420
They said

09:58.460 --> 10:00.160
it was set up by someone

10:00.200 --> 10:01.520
with the number ending in 6019.

10:02.060 --> 10:03.400
Ten yuan for a song.

10:03.440 --> 10:05.520
Yu Qiao, what's your problem?

10:05.560 --> 10:07.020
Coming up with new ways to mess with me?

10:08.580 --> 10:09.760
Wow, Yu Qiao.

10:09.800 --> 10:11.540
I thought we were friends.

10:11.580 --> 10:13.720
You gave one to Qin Yeyun

10:14.440 --> 10:15.400
but not to us?

10:15.440 --> 10:16.580
What kind of nonsense.

10:16.620 --> 10:18.440
Obviously it was Yu Jin.

10:18.480 --> 10:19.440
Yu Jin?

10:20.160 --> 10:22.240
You let Yu Jin use your phone again?

10:22.280 --> 10:24.280
Three songs. That's 30 yuan.

10:24.320 --> 10:25.200
Cancel it now.

10:26.180 --> 10:28.020
- Chill.
- I barely have any credit left.

10:29.360 --> 10:30.320
Where's your phone?

10:30.360 --> 10:31.500
In my bag.

10:41.200 --> 10:42.240
Here.

10:42.280 --> 10:43.440
Don't be mad.

10:43.940 --> 10:45.920
Ugh, that Yu Jin.

10:45.960 --> 10:47.100
He caused a mess again.

10:47.860 --> 10:48.780
Cancel it.

10:48.820 --> 10:50.560
Cancel what?

10:50.600 --> 10:52.160
Let him burn through his whole balance.

10:52.200 --> 10:54.340
Fine, burn it all.

11:12.040 --> 11:13.160
Is it gone?

11:21.800 --> 11:22.780
Lin Yingtao!

11:24.780 --> 11:26.120
Look.

11:26.160 --> 11:27.080
What?

11:27.700 --> 11:28.640
YOUR COMPATIBILITY INDEX
WITH LIN QILE IS 80%.

11:28.680 --> 11:29.900
YOU ARE HIGHLY IN TUNE WITH EACH OTHER.

11:29.940 --> 11:30.920
BUT IT COULD RUIN YOUR CAREER.

11:30.960 --> 11:31.900
PRESS A FOR ADVICE FROM ZHUGE

11:31.940 --> 11:33.280
PRESS B TO CHECK YOUR LUCK THIS YEAR

11:34.840 --> 11:36.040
Don't say anything.

11:43.840 --> 11:44.700
You…

11:49.480 --> 11:50.320
‪Where is she?

11:51.480 --> 11:53.380
Qin Yeyun!

11:53.420 --> 11:54.380
Qin…

12:01.680 --> 12:03.180
Stop. Just hear me out.

12:03.720 --> 12:04.860
What's there to say?

12:05.820 --> 12:07.520
It was clearly a joke.

12:09.260 --> 12:10.760
You're seriously mad at me?

12:11.940 --> 12:14.180
Well, now I'm mad that you're mad.

12:15.500 --> 12:17.080
So what do you want me to do?

12:17.120 --> 12:18.400
Should I clap for you?

12:18.440 --> 12:20.080
Pick you a ringtone to cheer you on?

12:20.620 --> 12:21.580
No, come on.

12:25.620 --> 12:26.860
Qin Yeyun,

12:26.900 --> 12:29.200
we're students.
Right now our priority should be school,

12:29.240 --> 12:30.660
not getting wrapped up in distractions.

12:30.700 --> 12:32.140
So what about Jiang Qiaoxi?

12:32.640 --> 12:34.020
Is he a distraction now too?

12:35.580 --> 12:36.860
Stop lying to yourself.

12:39.820 --> 12:40.840
Really, why?

12:42.780 --> 12:43.740
Did you two do anything wrong?

12:57.260 --> 12:58.700
What's with you?

12:58.740 --> 13:00.300
Why did you leave without us

13:00.340 --> 13:01.280
this morning?

13:01.320 --> 13:03.480
Yingtao, who upsets you?

13:04.120 --> 13:05.420
No one upsets me.

13:05.460 --> 13:06.900
I just wanted to be alone.

13:08.120 --> 13:10.780
- Wh… What did we do wrong?
- Why shut us out?

13:10.820 --> 13:12.280
I just want to focus on my studies.

13:12.940 --> 13:16.720
Lin Qile, come on. That's harsh.

13:16.760 --> 13:18.480
How exactly are we
stopping you from studying?

13:18.520 --> 13:19.960
You are distracting me.

13:20.000 --> 13:21.180
I've been helping you study.

13:23.940 --> 13:25.840
Your help is the reason I'm struggling.

13:26.540 --> 13:27.920
That balloon thing…

13:29.260 --> 13:30.480
- What happened?
- I did that

13:30.520 --> 13:31.460
balloon thing

13:31.500 --> 13:32.800
because I had no other choice.

13:32.840 --> 13:35.580
Enough. I know how to study now.

13:35.620 --> 13:37.080
So leave me alone.

13:38.940 --> 13:40.640
Especially you, Yu Qiao.

13:40.680 --> 13:41.820
Stop interfering.

13:42.920 --> 13:44.820
- What did you do?
- Nothing.

13:44.860 --> 13:45.900
I didn't do anything.

13:45.940 --> 13:47.380
Then why did she call you out?

14:15.600 --> 14:17.260
I came to school alone today.

14:17.300 --> 14:19.560
From now on, I won't be eating
with Yu Qiao and the others.

14:19.600 --> 14:21.540
The whole class sees me as a problem.

14:21.580 --> 14:23.080
I am not intended to fit in.

14:23.120 --> 14:25.460
So now I only have you to eat lunch with.

14:29.820 --> 14:31.220
Who asked you to push Yu Qiao away?

14:31.720 --> 14:33.280
Who asked you to change for me?

14:35.340 --> 14:36.180
Lin Yingtao,

14:36.220 --> 14:38.340
do you think acting selfless
makes you so great?

14:38.380 --> 14:39.940
Are we eating lunch or not?

14:39.980 --> 14:41.680
Or do you want to make me look worse?

14:41.720 --> 14:43.020
Are you with me or not?

14:55.880 --> 14:56.900
Guys, look.

14:58.060 --> 15:00.220
The way Qin Yeyun treats Yingtao?

15:00.260 --> 15:02.320
That's exactly how
Yingtao's been treating us.

15:03.020 --> 15:05.200
Wait, what happened
between Yingtao and Yeyun now?

15:06.880 --> 15:07.960
I get it.

15:08.000 --> 15:09.440
It's not like we did anything

15:09.480 --> 15:10.720
to upset Yingtao.

15:11.220 --> 15:13.600
It is a fallout between they two.

15:16.880 --> 15:18.920
We're just caught in the crossfire.

15:18.960 --> 15:20.560
We are the collateral damage.

15:21.240 --> 15:22.460
Pass the ball!

15:27.840 --> 15:28.900
Alright, class.

15:28.940 --> 15:31.040
This is the signup sheet
for the Sports Day events.

15:31.660 --> 15:33.400
Whatever you sign up for,

15:33.440 --> 15:34.960
take it seriously.

15:35.000 --> 15:35.840
We're doing this

15:35.880 --> 15:37.320
for class pride.

15:43.080 --> 15:43.920
Lin Qile,

15:43.960 --> 15:46.140
didn't expect this from you.

15:46.180 --> 15:47.500
You signed up for cheer squad?

15:48.040 --> 15:49.360
Looking forward to your performance.

15:50.060 --> 15:51.600
I didn't sign up for cheer squad.

15:51.640 --> 15:53.300
- She's in cheer squad?
- What?

15:53.340 --> 15:54.480
Who?

15:54.520 --> 15:55.500
Lin Qile.

15:56.000 --> 15:57.140
Seriously? With her grades?

15:57.180 --> 15:58.660
Still desperate for attention, huh?

15:58.700 --> 16:00.400
Not scared she'll get
kicked out of Class 18?

16:00.440 --> 16:01.660
I signed you up.

16:07.560 --> 16:09.140
You said it yourself

16:09.180 --> 16:11.580
that if I played in the basketball match,

16:12.380 --> 16:13.500
you'd cheer for me.

16:13.540 --> 16:15.280
So I helped you sign up.

16:17.140 --> 16:18.240
I…

16:18.280 --> 16:19.780
I don't want to do it.

16:19.820 --> 16:21.440
I need to study.

16:21.480 --> 16:23.080
I can't bomb the next test too.

16:23.120 --> 16:26.160
Studying takes time.

16:26.200 --> 16:27.560
You can't just grind all day.

16:28.120 --> 16:30.260
Doing cheer squad helps.
Balance, you know?

16:30.300 --> 16:31.760
Trust me.

16:34.420 --> 16:35.420
Yu Qiao.

16:35.920 --> 16:37.160
Do me a favor.

16:37.200 --> 16:38.960
Stop meddling in my life.

16:39.460 --> 16:40.420
Thanks.

16:49.120 --> 16:51.180
Guess who else signed up?

16:51.960 --> 16:52.840
Who?

16:53.800 --> 16:54.800
Lin Qile.

16:56.180 --> 16:57.840
Can't believe she actually signed up.

16:57.880 --> 16:59.220
Does she even know how to dance?

17:09.500 --> 17:11.420
Xiaoman, everything you have

17:11.460 --> 17:13.480
is so unique.

17:13.520 --> 17:14.680
I've never

17:14.720 --> 17:16.520
seen a bracelet like this
in all of Jialin City.

17:16.560 --> 17:18.819
If you like it, it's yours. Here.

17:18.859 --> 17:20.579
I can't.

17:20.619 --> 17:21.859
This looks expensive.

17:21.900 --> 17:23.359
Not really.

17:23.400 --> 17:24.440
My dad brought it

17:24.480 --> 17:26.240
back when he went overseas.

17:26.280 --> 17:27.240
He travels a lot

17:27.280 --> 17:28.700
and always brings stuff like this.

17:29.340 --> 17:30.420
If you like it, keep it.

17:31.140 --> 17:32.480
Thanks, Xiaoman.

17:32.520 --> 17:33.840
You're always so generous.

17:33.880 --> 17:35.880
Don't mention it.
We're on the same squad now.

17:40.540 --> 17:41.380
Look.

17:41.420 --> 17:42.660
There she is with that poker face.

17:42.700 --> 17:43.940
She's no fun at all.

17:43.980 --> 17:46.100
She was on the cheer squad last year too.

17:46.140 --> 17:48.280
Barely said a word to anyone.

17:48.320 --> 17:50.520
Excuse me, I'm Lin Qile from Class 18.

17:50.560 --> 17:51.880
Someone in my class

17:51.920 --> 17:53.080
- pranked me
- Who cares about her?

17:53.120 --> 17:55.080
- by signing me up for cheer squad.
- Exactly.

17:55.120 --> 17:56.860
I didn't want to join.

17:57.520 --> 17:58.820
You're Lin Qile?

17:58.860 --> 18:00.020
I know who you are.

18:00.060 --> 18:02.720
When we pick people,
we look at body type and balance.

18:03.220 --> 18:04.960
You've got a small frame.

18:05.000 --> 18:06.420
You're great for lift routines.

18:06.460 --> 18:08.580
Since you're here already,
join the practice.

18:08.620 --> 18:09.640
Ms…

18:09.680 --> 18:11.240
I…

18:11.280 --> 18:12.180
am afraid of heights.

18:12.680 --> 18:14.100
I can't do lifts.

18:14.860 --> 18:16.240
In fact,

18:16.280 --> 18:18.340
my grades have dropped recently…

18:23.260 --> 18:24.560
My grades have dropped, sure.

18:24.600 --> 18:25.960
Still,

18:26.000 --> 18:28.540
I want to take part
in something collective.

18:28.580 --> 18:31.000
So I'll face my fear.

18:31.040 --> 18:31.920
I can do this.

18:32.780 --> 18:34.640
- Great.
- I'll go join the others.

18:36.200 --> 18:37.240
Got your uniform?

18:37.960 --> 18:38.800
Yeah.

18:38.840 --> 18:39.800
Good.

18:50.820 --> 18:52.180
What are you listening to?

18:56.220 --> 18:57.280
What are you listening to?

19:04.520 --> 19:06.560
Even Lin Qile signed up?

19:06.600 --> 19:08.720
Wow, she really wants to be seen.

19:11.260 --> 19:12.320
It's open signup.

19:12.360 --> 19:15.000
If you meet the height
and build requirements, you're in.

19:15.880 --> 19:18.540
Here are the formation sketches.
They might change later.

19:27.000 --> 19:29.360
Hey, can we stand together
during the routine?

19:29.860 --> 19:31.620
If you don't answer,
I'll take that as a yes.

19:39.360 --> 19:40.260
Woah, it is loud.

19:44.800 --> 19:46.860
Alright, everyone, come stretch.

19:47.740 --> 19:49.400
Count your beats.

19:55.740 --> 19:56.660
Chang.

19:56.700 --> 19:57.620
Chang.

19:58.120 --> 19:59.700
- Shen me.
- Shen me.

19:59.740 --> 20:00.780
Come on, step into it!

20:10.920 --> 20:12.800
Yingtao said she wouldn't join.

20:12.840 --> 20:14.000
I knew she couldn't

20:14.040 --> 20:15.260
stay out of the spotlight.

20:15.300 --> 20:16.760
She's always been like this.

20:16.800 --> 20:18.000
Ever since we were kids.

20:18.040 --> 20:19.840
Every Children's Day,

20:19.880 --> 20:21.460
she was the first to volunteer.

20:23.640 --> 20:25.340
I signed her up for cheer squad

20:25.380 --> 20:26.880
because Qin Yeyun signed up.

20:27.800 --> 20:29.840
It might help patch things up
between them.

20:29.880 --> 20:31.220
And if they make up,

20:31.260 --> 20:33.160
the rest of us won't suffer for it.

20:38.020 --> 20:39.360
Shen me.

20:39.400 --> 20:41.380
Shen… Again.

20:41.420 --> 20:42.960
Shen me.

20:43.460 --> 20:45.180
Shen me.

20:45.220 --> 20:46.540
- Correct.
- Looking great, girls.

20:46.580 --> 20:47.580
Shen me.

20:47.620 --> 20:48.880
- Shen me.
- Nice hustle, everyone.

20:48.920 --> 20:51.280
Today we're blocking formations.

20:51.320 --> 20:52.980
Whoever nails it

20:53.020 --> 20:54.960
will lead the routine.

20:55.000 --> 20:57.400
Come on, Ms.

20:57.440 --> 20:59.060
Xiaoman's the obvious choice.

20:59.100 --> 21:00.320
She's made for center stage.

21:00.360 --> 21:01.760
Yeah, Cen Xiaoman, hands down.

21:03.240 --> 21:04.100
You all think so?

21:05.940 --> 21:07.940
Ms… Coach.

21:07.980 --> 21:09.720
Qin Yeyun dances really well too.

21:09.760 --> 21:11.200
And she's got the look.

21:11.240 --> 21:12.540
She should be considered.

21:13.040 --> 21:14.820
Can you not make a scene?

21:14.860 --> 21:16.700
Qin Yeyun would make a great lead.

21:16.740 --> 21:17.920
You did great last year.

21:18.820 --> 21:20.040
But Xiaoman's no slouch.

21:20.820 --> 21:22.000
Let's see how both of you do.

21:22.500 --> 21:24.400
Everyone, give it your best.

21:24.440 --> 21:25.960
Anyone could be picked.

21:28.140 --> 21:29.280
We're practicing

21:29.320 --> 21:31.340
group lifts today. Four per group.

21:31.380 --> 21:32.520
Pair yourselves up,

21:32.560 --> 21:34.720
decide who lifts and who's flying.

21:35.580 --> 21:36.460
- Got it.
- Sure.

21:39.740 --> 21:40.680
- Come with me.
- Okay.

21:45.840 --> 21:47.060
You four are together?

21:51.880 --> 21:54.640
Qin Yeyun, Lin Qile, you two are a team?

21:55.780 --> 21:58.160
- Ms, we're not…
- Ms,

21:58.660 --> 21:59.960
we're already paired.

22:00.000 --> 22:01.320
That won't work.

22:01.360 --> 22:02.900
You need four for a proper lift.

22:05.920 --> 22:06.860
You six, form a group.

22:09.020 --> 22:11.580
Wu Shuang, Han Xiaoxiao, join them.

22:13.200 --> 22:16.380
Ms, I don't really know them well.

22:16.420 --> 22:17.460
Qin Yeyun and Lin Qile.

22:17.500 --> 22:19.580
What's that got to do with anything?

22:19.620 --> 22:20.860
This is a school event,

22:20.900 --> 22:21.940
not a playdate.

22:21.980 --> 22:24.060
No, I mean,

22:24.100 --> 22:26.440
without basic trust,

22:26.480 --> 22:28.540
how can we pull this off?

22:29.080 --> 22:31.040
How can I trust them to catch me?

22:31.080 --> 22:32.960
And they probably

22:33.000 --> 22:33.940
don't trust me either.

22:33.980 --> 22:36.020
If you have that many issues,

22:36.060 --> 22:37.280
have the stage to yourself.

22:38.500 --> 22:39.580
I'll jump backwards.

22:39.620 --> 22:40.640
Catch me.

22:40.680 --> 22:42.060
Are you serious?

22:42.100 --> 22:43.740
That's kind of high. Scary.

22:43.780 --> 22:45.120
What's so scary about that?

22:45.620 --> 22:47.300
I've got the skill,
there's nothing to fear.

22:47.340 --> 22:49.280
Qin Yeyun, what do you mean?

22:49.320 --> 22:50.500
Just saying it like it is.

22:50.540 --> 22:51.700
Can't handle that?

22:51.740 --> 22:53.380
Guess your nine years of school
went to waste.

22:53.420 --> 22:54.860
Alright, knock it off.

22:55.360 --> 22:56.880
Wu Shuang, Qin Yeyun,

22:56.920 --> 22:58.320
talk it out.

22:59.200 --> 23:00.940
You're all part of the same team.

23:01.540 --> 23:03.000
You two, go to that group.

23:03.040 --> 23:04.320
Ms…

23:04.860 --> 23:06.580
Wu Shuang, one more complaint

23:06.620 --> 23:08.360
and you're out.
I can't coach you like this.

23:10.940 --> 23:12.660
Come on. Let's go.

23:15.480 --> 23:20.300
ROUTE 25, FROM DONGSHI ROAD
TO JIALIN BUS TERMINAL

23:22.380 --> 23:23.380
Here.

24:48.400 --> 24:50.260
- Alright, take five.
- You okay?

24:50.760 --> 24:51.920
Okay.

24:54.340 --> 24:55.560
- You okay?
- Yeah, I'm fine.

25:00.980 --> 25:03.260
This is hopeless. You're a goner.

25:12.960 --> 25:15.160
Qin Yeyun, you alright?

25:18.060 --> 25:19.140
Help me go over it again.

25:19.180 --> 25:20.480
If I mess up, they'll laugh at me.

25:20.520 --> 25:21.740
Every time

25:21.780 --> 25:22.760
we switch moves,

25:22.800 --> 25:24.080
I get lost.

25:24.120 --> 25:25.020
I can't keep up.

25:26.020 --> 25:27.720
Well, they have every reason to laugh.

25:28.220 --> 25:29.600
This is you.

25:29.640 --> 25:30.600
Like a baby giraffe.

25:31.420 --> 25:32.420
Qin Yeyun.

25:32.920 --> 25:34.100
- Ms.
- Nicely done.

25:34.640 --> 25:36.360
Even knowing Lin Qile's struggling,

25:36.400 --> 25:37.680
you're still helping her.

25:38.180 --> 25:39.960
Your tone could use work,

25:40.000 --> 25:41.400
but I like the effort.

25:41.440 --> 25:43.440
- Ms…
- Ms, yeah.

25:43.480 --> 25:45.400
Qin Yeyun really was helping me.

25:45.440 --> 25:46.880
She's killing it with her own move.

25:46.920 --> 25:47.760
She is helping me too.

25:47.800 --> 25:50.040
She's got the moves and the heart.

25:50.080 --> 25:52.580
Pretty, talented, kind.

25:52.620 --> 25:53.820
That's everything

25:53.860 --> 25:55.280
a lead dancer should be.

25:55.320 --> 25:56.260
Good work.

25:56.300 --> 25:57.360
Oh,

25:57.400 --> 25:58.760
and she also offered to stay

25:58.800 --> 25:59.820
after evening classes

25:59.860 --> 26:02.380
and train me for half an hour

26:02.420 --> 26:04.380
until I get it.

26:05.480 --> 26:06.400
That's amazing.

26:06.440 --> 26:07.980
Take good care of her, okay?

26:08.020 --> 26:08.880
Let's go, team.

26:11.580 --> 26:12.520
Let's go, team.

26:18.300 --> 26:19.300
Qin Yeyun,

26:19.940 --> 26:21.080
you know

26:21.120 --> 26:23.320
why I wanted you to stay late with me?

26:23.820 --> 26:24.860
I don't want to know.

26:27.100 --> 26:30.240
Because I want us to go home together.

26:31.920 --> 26:34.300
You know why I agreed to stay?

26:34.840 --> 26:35.720
Why?

26:39.300 --> 26:40.700
No! I can't!

26:40.740 --> 26:41.720
So your screaming

26:41.760 --> 26:43.240
wouldn't bother the rest of the team.

26:45.100 --> 26:46.540
I said train me,

26:46.580 --> 26:48.280
not torture me.

26:48.320 --> 26:50.100
Crawl before you walk.

26:50.140 --> 26:51.840
- Take it or leave it.
- Ow!

26:54.520 --> 26:55.740
Am I there yet?

26:55.780 --> 26:56.960
How many more?

26:57.980 --> 26:59.040
Just 100.

26:59.880 --> 27:02.240
No good moves with poor stamina.

27:03.000 --> 27:04.320
You in or out?

27:04.360 --> 27:05.460
I'm in.

27:07.140 --> 27:09.180
Didn't expect you to stick it out.

27:09.720 --> 27:11.940
I need to get stronger.

27:12.440 --> 27:14.300
I want to make sure
I can hold you next time.

27:14.340 --> 27:15.680
No more dropping you.

27:15.720 --> 27:17.380
Don't act like I only have you.

27:17.420 --> 27:18.280
There are two others

27:18.320 --> 27:19.540
spotting me.

27:38.740 --> 27:41.020
STADIUM

27:58.800 --> 28:00.040
Qin Yeyun,

28:00.080 --> 28:02.380
when did you take dance lessons?

28:02.880 --> 28:04.100
You're really good.

28:04.140 --> 28:05.400
I never did.

28:06.040 --> 28:07.460
I practiced on my own.

28:07.500 --> 28:09.120
You learned all that by yourself?

28:09.160 --> 28:10.760
Seriously?

28:11.260 --> 28:12.580
That's impressive.

28:13.420 --> 28:14.860
It's nothing.

28:14.900 --> 28:16.340
I needed to prove that I could do it.

28:16.840 --> 28:19.080
Even without all their fancy stuff,

28:19.120 --> 28:20.340
I knew I could be just as good.

28:20.380 --> 28:22.100
No. Even better.

28:22.840 --> 28:25.240
I want to be someone I'm proud of.

28:30.300 --> 28:31.380
Don't worry.

28:32.020 --> 28:33.920
As one of your lifters,

28:33.960 --> 28:35.620
I'm not letting you down.

29:19.460 --> 29:20.340
Yingtao.

29:22.360 --> 29:23.360
Yingtao…

29:25.580 --> 29:27.140
- Um…
- What's up?

29:27.180 --> 29:28.160
Jiang Qiaoxi…

29:29.420 --> 29:30.980
What happened with Jiang Qiaoxi?

29:31.020 --> 29:32.440
He ran into an old Olympiad classmate

29:32.940 --> 29:34.500
of mine at his new school.

29:34.540 --> 29:35.980
He asked for my number.

29:36.720 --> 29:37.800
And?

29:37.840 --> 29:39.440
He called me.

29:39.480 --> 29:40.740
Then he asked for yours.

29:41.480 --> 29:43.060
Get to the point.

29:43.100 --> 29:44.480
He's calling you right now.

29:45.960 --> 29:47.140
You've been ignoring it.

30:02.240 --> 30:04.000
The number you dialed

30:04.040 --> 30:05.420
is currently busy.

30:05.460 --> 30:06.780
Please try again later.

30:19.060 --> 30:22.520
One, two, three, four.

30:23.780 --> 30:24.900
Jiang Qiaoxi.

30:26.100 --> 30:27.740
Hey, Yingtao?

30:29.460 --> 30:30.680
Jiang Qiaoxi.

30:31.300 --> 30:32.440
How have you been lately?

30:38.480 --> 30:39.460
I…

30:41.380 --> 30:42.580
Wait,

30:43.080 --> 30:44.340
did something happen?

30:45.340 --> 30:46.540
No. I'm okay.

30:47.640 --> 30:48.760
I'm doing fine.

30:50.220 --> 30:52.080
The only flaw is

30:52.800 --> 30:53.800
you are not arround.

30:55.320 --> 30:56.920
But you'll be back eventually, right?

30:57.960 --> 30:58.960
So

31:00.200 --> 31:01.200
it's okay.

31:04.080 --> 31:05.620
Don't worry about me.

31:05.660 --> 31:07.260
As long as I stay focused,

31:07.760 --> 31:09.040
nothing at school can beat me.

31:09.840 --> 31:11.700
You know me.

31:16.640 --> 31:18.860
How's it going for you over there?

31:22.880 --> 31:24.080
If you're doing alright,

31:24.120 --> 31:25.360
I've got no complaints.

31:28.880 --> 31:30.040
Jiang Qiaoxi, lights out!

31:32.640 --> 31:33.900
Shouldn't you hang up soon?

31:35.100 --> 31:37.120
Aren't you not allowed
to call after hours?

31:37.660 --> 31:38.720
Not really.

31:38.760 --> 31:40.180
Lights out soon.

31:40.220 --> 31:41.760
But I've got a bit of time left.

31:44.080 --> 31:45.840
What do you wanna talk about?

31:47.220 --> 31:49.420
I think

31:50.380 --> 31:52.260
you should get some sleep.

31:52.300 --> 31:53.720
Rest is important.

31:55.060 --> 31:57.240
I hope the next time we see each other,

31:58.740 --> 31:59.960
we're both in a good place.

32:01.760 --> 32:02.600
We will be.

32:27.860 --> 32:28.960
Nice job, everyone.

32:29.740 --> 32:30.720
Looking great.

32:31.460 --> 32:32.960
Strong presence.

32:34.220 --> 32:35.720
Sharp rhythm.

32:38.540 --> 32:40.600
Nice work, Lin Qile.
You've really stepped it up.

32:53.960 --> 32:54.900
- What's wrong?
- Xiaoman?

32:54.940 --> 32:55.700
Xiaoman?

32:55.740 --> 32:57.580
- You okay?
- Want to head to the nurse?

32:59.120 --> 32:59.960
Give me a second.

33:00.000 --> 33:01.280
Are you alright?

33:03.240 --> 33:05.380
It wasn't her fault, Teacher.
Lin Qile didn't mean it.

33:06.680 --> 33:09.340
No, you stepped on my foot.

33:14.300 --> 33:15.140
You're right,

33:15.180 --> 33:16.400
it was me.

33:16.900 --> 33:18.120
I'm sorry, Lin Qile.

33:18.920 --> 33:20.980
What's that supposed to mean?

33:21.020 --> 33:22.920
- You…
- Alright, that's enough.

33:22.960 --> 33:24.280
Take a break, everyone.

33:24.320 --> 33:26.180
You two, help her off to the side.

33:28.560 --> 33:29.580
Careful now.

33:44.380 --> 33:46.420
You okay, Xiaoman?

33:47.840 --> 33:48.780
Yeah,

33:49.580 --> 33:51.600
I just hope it doesn't
throw off my routine.

33:53.180 --> 33:55.060
That Lin Qile really crossed a line.

33:55.100 --> 33:56.700
Ms said one nice thing

33:56.740 --> 33:58.460
and she jumped at the chance
to take you down.

33:59.180 --> 34:00.120
You think

34:00.160 --> 34:01.360
she's trying to steal your spot

34:01.400 --> 34:02.440
as lead?

34:03.800 --> 34:04.840
No way.

34:06.260 --> 34:08.219
I don't even know if I want to stay.

34:10.540 --> 34:12.060
If anyone should leave, it's her.

34:12.100 --> 34:13.659
People like that don't belong here.

34:14.239 --> 34:15.820
She's worked way too hard to walk now.

34:15.860 --> 34:17.219
She's not quitting.

34:19.199 --> 34:20.760
You're not thinking of leaving, are you?

34:21.260 --> 34:23.199
If you go, I'm going too.

34:23.239 --> 34:24.280
Same here.

34:24.320 --> 34:25.159
I'm with you, Xiaoman.

34:27.080 --> 34:28.239
You all said it.

34:28.820 --> 34:30.060
But even if you leave,

34:30.100 --> 34:31.440
others will take your place.

34:31.940 --> 34:33.260
If I can teach Lin Qile,

34:33.300 --> 34:34.900
I can teach anyone.

34:34.940 --> 34:36.139
Might even

34:36.179 --> 34:38.060
to be captain while I'm at it.

34:40.000 --> 34:42.340
Cen Xiaoman, don't back out now.

35:07.380 --> 35:09.660
I know you're not mad at me anymore.

35:10.180 --> 35:12.440
I heard everything.
You stuck up for me today.

35:18.100 --> 35:19.640
Stop acting like you don't care.

35:20.240 --> 35:22.760
That was really cool of you.

35:29.280 --> 35:30.320
How about this?

35:30.360 --> 35:32.200
Sunday we go get the outfits.

35:32.240 --> 35:34.720
After that, you can take me shopping.

35:34.760 --> 35:36.920
You said I've lost my style

35:36.960 --> 35:38.480
since transferring here.

35:38.520 --> 35:40.300
Well, you're the style queen.

35:40.340 --> 35:41.780
Help me fix it.

35:43.680 --> 35:44.640
Then we grab

35:44.680 --> 35:46.180
some bubble tea.

35:46.220 --> 35:47.560
That'll make it

35:47.600 --> 35:48.820
our official

35:48.860 --> 35:49.820
makeup session.

35:49.860 --> 35:50.960
What do you say?

35:52.760 --> 35:53.900
I'll think about it.

35:56.560 --> 35:57.400
Alright.

35:57.900 --> 35:59.260
Think hard.

36:02.800 --> 36:05.380
Qin Yeyun…

36:07.280 --> 36:08.740
Seriously?

36:15.420 --> 36:16.880
Lin Qile,

36:16.920 --> 36:18.080
where's Qin Yeyun?

36:18.120 --> 36:20.400
She left you hanging?

36:21.820 --> 36:22.680
Wu Shuang,

36:22.720 --> 36:23.680
drop it.

36:51.380 --> 36:53.120
This outfit is adorable.

36:53.160 --> 36:54.000
Check this out.

36:54.040 --> 36:55.420
- Wow, it looks amazing on you.
- Nice.

36:55.460 --> 36:56.420
Give us a twirl.

36:56.460 --> 36:58.420
Here. Ready?

36:58.460 --> 37:01.080
Three, two, one.

37:02.340 --> 37:03.280
Great for long legs.

37:03.320 --> 37:04.600
Let me see.

37:04.640 --> 37:05.740
Try it.

37:05.780 --> 37:07.120
I like this one.

37:07.160 --> 37:08.380
Purple lightens your look.

37:08.420 --> 37:09.720
The purple makes your skin pop.

37:09.760 --> 37:11.880
This red one's kind of nice too.

37:13.100 --> 37:14.720
Red is way too loud.

37:14.760 --> 37:16.200
- So tacky.
- Let's try this one.

37:16.240 --> 37:17.240
Yeah, let's try it.

37:17.280 --> 37:19.020
- Let's try this one.
- Yeah, let's try it.

37:19.060 --> 37:21.160
- Come on.
- Xiaoman,

37:21.200 --> 37:23.300
you look stunning in that.

37:23.340 --> 37:25.100
You look even fairer..

37:25.140 --> 37:26.220
- Really suits you.
- That's so good.

37:26.260 --> 37:27.380
Totally.

37:27.420 --> 37:29.780
- Gorgeous.
- You look amazing.

37:29.820 --> 37:31.040
Shows off your waist too.

37:31.080 --> 37:32.640
Our team's skin tone is perfect

37:32.680 --> 37:33.600
for red.

37:33.640 --> 37:35.620
We'll all glow in it.
Red's definitely the move.

37:35.660 --> 37:36.680
You're right.

37:36.720 --> 37:38.280
You're so thoughtful, Xiaoman.

37:38.320 --> 37:39.320
Always thinking of the team.

37:39.360 --> 37:41.400
Of course we trust your fashion sense.

37:42.380 --> 37:43.940
So red it is?

37:43.980 --> 37:44.820
Everyone in?

37:44.860 --> 37:45.960
Yeah, sure.

37:46.000 --> 37:47.040
We're team Xiaoman.

37:47.580 --> 37:48.440
It really is pretty.

37:48.480 --> 37:50.020
Makes your legs look so long.

37:50.900 --> 37:51.800
And your skin?

37:51.840 --> 37:53.060
Glowing.

37:53.100 --> 37:54.260
Good choice.

37:57.140 --> 37:58.580
Lin Qile, what do you think?

38:05.720 --> 38:07.920
Like I have a choice.

38:08.500 --> 38:09.860
Don't be like that.

38:09.900 --> 38:11.520
I may be lead, but I'll respect

38:11.560 --> 38:12.460
everyone's vote.

38:13.000 --> 38:14.300
So, thoughts?

38:20.160 --> 38:21.000
Lin Qile,

38:21.040 --> 38:23.540
just go with the group.

38:23.580 --> 38:24.720
Red it is.

38:25.260 --> 38:26.880
Make sure you grab Qin Yeyun's outfit.

38:28.940 --> 38:31.260
Xiaoman, that really looks amazing on you.

38:31.800 --> 38:33.880
- Makes your posture look perfect.
- So this is the one?

38:33.920 --> 38:36.160
- Yep.
- Let me check the back for your sizes.

38:38.680 --> 38:40.280
- Is this your size?
- Is it a small?

38:40.320 --> 38:42.040
- Yeah, small.
- Yes.

38:42.080 --> 38:43.300
Want me to take it in a bit?

38:43.340 --> 38:45.080
Yeah, in the middle.

38:45.960 --> 38:47.200
Here you go.

39:03.880 --> 39:06.160
Wait for me, this one's got an issue.

39:09.020 --> 39:10.900
Excuse me, ma'am?

39:10.940 --> 39:12.440
This one's discolored.

39:13.980 --> 39:15.860
Oh, you're right. Hang on,

39:15.900 --> 39:17.720
I'll grab a fresh one from the stockroom.

39:18.220 --> 39:19.980
- Can you make it quick?
- Sure.

39:27.180 --> 39:29.380
Wait for me, guys!

39:30.100 --> 39:34.380
NO CLIMBING, STAY SAFE

40:04.280 --> 40:05.880
CONTACTS

40:05.920 --> 40:06.760
JIANG QIAOXI

41:22.320 --> 41:23.160
Yingtao…

45:15.340 --> 45:17.840
Subtitle translation by: Jiaxin Wang
